markdown-rust incorporates a Rust implementation of the Markdown rendering
behavior described by the upstream project below. The pure-Python fallback
(`markdown/`, except `_bridge.py` and the marked hooks in `core.py`) is a
byte-identical copy of the upstream 3.11.2 `markdown` package, used when the
Rust extension is unavailable or the render is outside the kernel's exact
domain (and as the correctness oracle for the equivalence suite):

